\[ P_3(x) = \frac{1}{3!} \left \left \frac{1}{2} \right^3 (120x^3 - 72x) \right \right = \frac{1}{6} \left \left \frac{1}{8} (120x^3 - 72x) \right \right \right = \frac{1}{6} \left \left \frac{1}{8} (120x^3 - 72x) \right \right \right \]
