<USER_REQUEST>
Marky owns a computer accessory shop. For this month, they sold a total of 80 mice, one-fourth are optical mice, and 20 are trackball mice. What is the ratio of wireless mice to the total mice sold?
</USER_REQUEST>

<GROUND_TRUTH>
