","The problem involves heat transfer from a diecast component to air. The lumped parameter model can be used if the temperature distribution within the component is uniform. The lumped parameter model is valid when the time to reach the average temperature is much longer than the time to reach the temperature at the surface.  

(i) The temperature of the part after 5 minutes.  
(ii) The time required to reach 50°C.  
