     \]  
   - **Heat transfer coefficient \( h_s \):**  
     \[
     h_s = h \cdot A = 56.8 \, \text{W/m}^2 \text{K} \times 0.075 \, \text{m}^2 = 4.26 \, \text{W/K}
     \]  
   - **Time constant \( \tau \):**  
     \[
     \tau = \frac{m c}{h_s} = \frac{1.2 \, \text{kg} \times 385 \, \text{J/kg K}}{4.26 \, \text{W/K}} = 100.24 \, \text{min}
     \]  
